{
  "summary": "The Classic 60/40 portfolio has delivered a compound annual growth rate (CAGR) of 10.26% over the past decade, outperforming the benchmark SPY by a significant margin. However, it also experienced a maximum drawdown of -22.20%, indicating a substantial potential for loss during market downturns.",
